### Cards - Update

PUT {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "{{title}}",
  "description": "{{description}}",
  "type": "{{type}}",
  "priority": "{{priority}}",
  "assignee_id": "{{assigneeId}}",
  "due_date": "{{due_date}}",
  "expected_version": {{expected_version}}
}
